(TauCetiProject/TauCeti) and from YijunYuan/TrustworthyKedlaya under Apache-2.0,
and its lean_mlv project vendors modules of n-yamaguchi-0729/NYLL at commit
8c1b16d10afaca09e0dc72753c6575e230d31a55 under Apache-2.0, with one disclosed
import change. Pinned commits, original notices and the license texts are in
lean/THIRD_PARTY.md, lean_mlv/THIRD_PARTY.md, lean_mlv/third_party/ and lean_mlv/vendor/.

The Keller–Klein sharp-stability package includes, unchanged from the
keller-klein package, three Lean support modules adapted from
Jiyuan-Tan/CausalSmith at commit a7085d88d2e4b30003db7097ca374f4718da0f01
under Apache-2.0. The original files, license, notice and a description of the
changes are in papers/mathematics/keller-klein-sharp-stability/third_party/causalsmith/.

